  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Creating a chat / Sending SMS\"\nslug: \"/apps/desktop-creating-chat-sms--wq59474ron4rofgdi73acjxw\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"Desktop\",\"General\",\"desktop\",\"sms\",\"working-with-chats\"]\n---\n\n> Availability of this feature depends on your service configuration. Contact support for details.\n\n*Looking for an&#x20;*[Android](/docs/apps/android-sending-messages--ztffi0qzjlvj88mlxkg556r3) *or&#x20;*[iOS](/docs/apps/ios-sending-sms-message--u9er4aaxgafnsgkjp9bl527u) *version of this article?*\n\nTo create a chat or send an SMS:\n\n1. Click on an![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/cc1a7dcd36a2aa8941be/732f38ce89390294a03c02465fd0e412e5db687c082496a41277c5dcd6738c66.png)icon at the right side of the tab name.\n2. Choose **Create Chat&#x20;**&#x66;rom a drop-down menu.\n3. Select a **User&#x20;**&#x66;rom the list to create a personal cha&#x74;**.**\n\n**OR**\n\n1. Enter a phone number in the search field and choose an external contact to create an SMS chat. \\*\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/62886e1cb757c3e9ca0b/10040b5fc80e15bb526cb0185bebb78f25d11eb33e12357f969953fc982bfebe.png)\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/eadd6cb4d8a6b19504d9/561e72341f9c19dd13fcb3f965f77795a560fa8b11466be29a89aa027dbec306.png)\n\n*\\* Please check the availability of this feature with your PBX Administrator.*\n"
